;\">)</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">대상학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;1)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">학부의&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">학년 이상 재학생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">석사연계과정 선발생</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">3.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">일반대학원 교과목 수강학점&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">학기당&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">학점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">이내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;1</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 11pt;\">학부과목과 대학원과목을 합하여 학생의 학기당 수강신청 최대 학점 이내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;2)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">초과학기자 및 학</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;\">․</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">석사연계과정은 학기당&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">학점</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 32.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;3)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">학부 학생이 취득한 대학원 교과목은 수강한 학기의 학부 성적표에 학점과&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">성적은 표기되나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 32.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;이수학점계 및 평균평점 계산에는 반영되지 않으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">학생이 우리대학교 일반대학원에 입학한 후&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 32.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;대학원 성적으로 인정한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">. (S</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">로 표기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 32.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 32.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.3pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">4.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-size: 11pt;\">본교 학부 재학 중 대학원 과목을 사전 이수한 학부생이 대학원에 입학한 경우</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 32.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;대학원 석사과정 수료</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">또는 졸업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">을 위한&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">수업연한을&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">개월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">(1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">학기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;\">단축&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 32.3pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -32.3pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;학부생 일반대학원 교과목 이수 지침 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">수업연한 단축</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-al